## Why This Is Asked

Privacy and governance in telemetry pipelines are critical; this question probes tenant isolation, data masking, erasure guarantees, and cross-region consistency under cost constraints.

## Key Concepts

- Tenant-scoped partitioning and access control
- PII masking at ingest; tombstones for erasure
- Immutable audit trail via OpenTelemetry and S3 Object Lock concepts
- Cross-region replication and DR testing with Glue/Athena catalog
- Cost and latency trade-offs between Lambda and Fargate

## Code Example

```javascript
// PII masking at ingest
function maskPII(record) {
  if (!record.user) return record;
  const masked = { ...record };
  if (masked.user.email) masked.user.email = masked.user.email.replace(/@.*/, "@redacted");
  if (masked.user.phone) masked.user.phone = masked.user.phone.replace(/\d{4,}$/,"****");
  return masked;
}
```

